#slide()[
#text(size: 30pt, weight: "bold")[Real-World Applications of Multiplying Fractions]
#v(40pt)
#text(size: 20pt, weight: "bold")[5) Solution: b) 3/8]
#v(40pt)
#only("1-")[- You have $3/4$ of a chocolate bar.]
#only("2-")[- You eat $1/2$ of it.]
#only("3-")[- How much of the whole chocolate bar did you eat?]
#v(40pt)
#only("1")[#voiceover("Not quite, but let's go through the solution step-by-step.")]
#only("2")[#voiceover("You have three-fourths of a chocolate bar.")]
#only("3")[#voiceover("You eat one-half of it.")]
#only("4")[#voiceover("Now, we need to find out how much of the whole chocolate bar you ate.")]
]


#slide()[
#text(size: 30pt, weight: "bold")[Step-by-Step Solution]
#v(40pt)
#only("1-")[- To find out how much you ate, we multiply the fractions: $3/4$ and $1/2$.]
#v(20pt)
#only("2-")[- $3/4$ $dot$ $1/2$ = $3 dot 1 / (4 dot 2)$]
#v(20pt)
#only("3-")[- This simplifies to $3/8$.]
#v(40pt)
#only("1")[#voiceover("To find out how much you ate, we need to multiply the fractions three-fourths and one-half.")]
#only("2")[#voiceover("So, we multiply three-fourths by one-half. This gives us three times one divided by four times two.")]
#only("3")[#voiceover("This simplifies to three-eighths.")]
]


#slide()[
#text(size: 30pt, weight: "bold")[Answer Explanation]
#v(40pt)
#only("1-")[- The correct answer is $3/8$.]
#v(20pt)
#only("2-")[- Let's look at the other options and explain why they are incorrect:]
#v(20pt)
#only("3-")[- a) $1/4$: This would be if you ate one-fourth of the whole bar, not one-half of three-fourths.]
#v(20pt)
#only("4-")[- c) $1/2$: This would be if you ate one-half of the whole bar, not one-half of three-fourths.]
#v(20pt)
#only("5-")[- d) $3/4$: This would be if you ate the entire three-fourths of the chocolate bar, not one-half of it.]
#v(40pt)
#only("1")[#voiceover("The correct answer is three-eighths.")]
#only("2")[#voiceover("Let's look at the other options and explain why they are incorrect.")]
#only("3")[#voiceover("Option a) one-fourth would be if you ate one-fourth of the whole bar, not one-half of three-fourths.")]
#only("4")[#voiceover("Option c) one-half would be if you ate one-half of the whole bar, not one-half of three-fourths.")]
#only("5")[#voiceover("Option d) three-fourths would be if you ate the entire three-fourths of the chocolate bar, not one-half of it.")]
]